"""Dependency-free authenticated Marketplace page.

One page in tabs (owner 2026-10-15): every member has Marketplace, My
published assets, My submissions and Applications; a platform administrator
also has Overview (their default), Review queue, Registrations (Bridges), All
published assets and Members & invitations. The tab is kept in the URL hash
(`#tab=<name>`), so reload and back keep it. Asset cards are one size; a
card's detail (its published content, from `assets/manifest`) opens inside
the tab. Text from the platform is set as text; Markdown instructions go
through a small renderer that escapes everything first.

Sign-in (owner 2026-10-15, `docs/phases/PASSWORD_SIGN_IN.md`): account and
password first; an invitation or password reset link opens "Set your
password" and signs in. The header's "Password" sets or changes it, and
administrators issue reset links and force sign-out from Members.
"""

# The inline HTML/CSS/JavaScript is shipped as one package-safe string.
# ruff: noqa: E501

